# Next.js & TailwindCSS Development Guide

## **Core Architecture Patterns**

- **App Router Structure**: Use Next.js 15+ app directory with proper route groups
- **Server Components**: Default to server components, use client components only when needed
- **TypeScript**: Strict mode enabled, proper type definitions for all props and APIs
- **Tailwind CSS**: Utility-first styling with custom design system
- **Shadcn UI**: Consistent component library with proper theming

## **Component Development Standards**

