## **Common Anti-Patterns**

### **❌ DON'T: Avoid These Manufacturing UI Mistakes**
```typescript
// ❌ DON'T: Block UI with synchronous operations
function BadProductionDashboard() {
  const [data, setData] = useState();
  
  // This blocks the UI during data fetching
  useEffect(() => {
    const result = fetchProductionDataSync(); // Blocking call
    setData(result);
  }, []);
}

// ❌ DON'T: Ignore real-time data performance
function BadTelemetryChart({ data }: { data: TelemetryPoint[] }) {
  // This re-renders on every data point
  return data.map(point => <DataPoint key={Math.random()} {...point} />);
}

// ❌ DON'T: Hardcode manufacturing values
const TEMPERATURE_THRESHOLD = 85; // Should be configurable
const BATCH_SIZE_LIMIT = 5000; // Should come from configuration
```

